{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384973-how-to-bring-alternate-versions-of-a-character-together","id":1384973,"title":"How to bring alternate versions of a character together?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-30T18:30:05-07:00","id":1384973,"title":"How to bring alternate versions of a character together?","content":"I had an idea for a story, but am stuck on how to execute the crux of the plot. A little background first:<br /> <br /> I have project I worked on where I took a character and made 5 versions, one for each exalt type. Basically change the circumstances of one mortal's Exaltation story to change what they become. Alternate tmelines if you will. That was just for fun. But now I'm wanting to bring all 5 together. As though all 5 exist at once in one timeline and have it be a surprise when that happens.<br /> <br /> So how could that happen? Massively fuck up the Loom? Sorcery? Primordials again? I'm wracking my brain and not comng up with soeting I feel s satisfactory. Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T19:13:23-07:00","id":1384984,"title":"","content":"Merging multiple alternate realities together sounds like a very Getimian plot. I think Thulio, an E5 Getimian or even the Getimian Incarna could have done it, but the issue is we don't have enough Getimian lore yet to reliably formulate how they would do it.<br /> <br /> One thing we know is that Thulio undid a seal on the Getimian Exaltations in order to free them, so maybe someone else tried to mess with the seal or even put it back in place, and this happened as a side effect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T00:01:56-07:00","id":1385022,"title":"","content":"Have an ancient First Age Manse that all five characters are independently exploring. They all reach the Hearthstone chamber at the same time and go &quot;Wha-?!&quot;<br /> <br /> No further explaination required. And/or explaination becomes what the Story is about as they quest together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T05:50:29-07:00","id":1385062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384973-how-to-bring-alternate-versions-of-a-character-together?p=1385022#post1385022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have an ancient First Age Manse that all five characters are independently exploring. They all reach the Hearthstone chamber at the same time and go &quot;Wha-?!&quot;<br /> <br /> No further explaination required. And/or explaination becomes what the Story is about as they quest together.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I think that's the most Exalted way to do it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T06:15:31-07:00","id":1385067,"title":"","content":"I\u2019unno, <i>Anansi Boys</i> handled a similar idea pretty well. \u201cFat Charlie\u201d Nancy learns after his father\u2019s death that he has a brother he doesn\u2019t remember, so he gives him a call\u2026<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">It turns out that Fat Charlie is a God-Blooded, and after some mischief on his part as a kid, a witch uses a sorcerous working to separate his human and divine halves, who each go on to be their own person.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-01-2020, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T09:04:27-07:00","id":1385083,"title":"","content":"This is the sort of thing we covered in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381414-spider-man-s-clone-saga-but-with-exalted\">Spider-Man's Clone Saga... but with Exalted</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T12:50:59-07:00","id":1385124,"title":"","content":"One idea I'm playing with now though, that everyone who knew her remembers aspects of all her different lives simultaneously. So Mnemon, for example, remembers tricking her into following the Empress deeper into the Imperial manse and this one disappearing (Solar/Abyssal), but also hearing the news about when the girl's Terrestrial Aspect manifested (Dragon Blood), hearing the news of the girl's disappearence after a break in at a country side estate (Lunar), and so forth. And it's not till it's brought up anyone realized they do have conflicting memories and realize it's weird. In this way there aren't any versions who just appear and not have their associated c\\personal connections not know them (the Abyssal being unknown to her Deathlord for example, I don't want that). Though, this is just a thought. Like everything I do I have lots of conflicting ideas about it and am thinking out loud.<br /> <br /> <br /> And I guess I should say it now, yes this is Lillun. This started as me trying to retcon her into a proper Exalt now that 3E seems to be going a different direction with the Infernals. And has grown from there","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}